WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:06.100
Alerts: searches customers saved to hear about new matching listings.

2
00:00:06.646 --> 00:00:10.770
Review the list and each search's "Criteria" and "Matches".

3
00:00:11.317 --> 00:00:18.080
With a new listing, matching people are told automatically; timing and count are in "New-listing alerts".

4
